                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "In between admiring the artistic style of this game, rejoicing on the cuteness of the characters, getting thrilled by the level design, and enjoying the progression of gameplay mechanics; I often found myself gasping for air at absurdly millimetric deaths, increasing my swear word count due to my forgetful habit of not saving, slamming my desk because of my unsuccessful attempts to speedrun recovering the lost progress, and ultimately laughing in a high-pitched maniatic voice at the spiraling episodes of dying tens of times on the same place.\r\n\r\nRecommended if you don't have undiagnosed anger management issues like me 👍",
